  "An opera waited nearly 180 years for its premiere.",
  "Gaetano Donizetti finished composing L'Ange de Nisida in 1839.",
  "The plot involved the mistress of a Neapolitan king.",
  "Because of censors, he planned to show it in France.",
  "That theater company went bankrupt.",
  "The score was reworked into La favorite.",
  "It finally debuted at London's Royal Opera House in 2018."
